          "key": "p01",
          "data": {
            "name": "P01｜归航路径",
            "config_ref": "objects/text.toml",
            "information": {
              "text": "S01 → A01 → S02 → A03〔tide_code=true〕→ S03 → A05〔brass_key=true〕→ S04 → A06〔核对两件均 true〕→ S05 → A08 → S07 → A09 → E01。\n初始状态 (false,false)，最终 (true,true)。这是唯一能进入检修窗的前缀；所有箭头对应“可选动作/进入场景/进入结局”的 bind。详见 paths.md 的逐步表。",
              "role": "path"
            },
            "begin": 1,
            "end": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "object",
          "op": "add",
          "key": "p02",
          "data": {
            "name": "P02｜守职路径",
            "config_ref": "objects/text.toml",
            "information": {
              "text": "S01 → A02 → S03 → A05〔brass_key=true〕→ S04 → A07 → S06 → A10 → E02。\n初始 (false,false)，旋梯口 (false,true)。没有暗码，A06 不可按故事条件选择；改走 A07 可合法结束。详见 paths.md。",
